"моим Небесным."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F20F6B5_7851_4BB9_A029_3CEBF40D25D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45c25cc4f6e134900096e40c5212cb76fdb447fa23e701cf486fd659897e8b76
