#: scenario8:scenario8_E7196C4C_C56F_4F6C_B3D6_3BC9BDBFAA29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69318e800b90e0e7f6e63e64c489e01d065794a609d39b64d12b0a131ab6cde9
